47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Breakfast & Brunch, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":5},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"MDtu8_LFbbkCgzCzIoEWng","review_id":"0zbBkWUdo-YCIdSqVc0XXA","date":"2021-03-13T01:20:31","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9370872378349304,"text_excerpt":"I am so impressed with this establishment. First off they are doing a extensive job following all Covid rules, they are several steps ahead of the other restaurants around them. The entire place is spotless, bathrooms included. The whole staff is Pleasent and personable. Server was very efficient and attentive. The food...I believe that was the best salad I ever ate, no joke. The bartender did a wine pairing for the salad and it was spot on. The atmosphere is very classy. They are affiliated with the store next door which sells everything a vampire could want! All and all great experience. I will be bringing friends here in April on my next visit"},{"business_id":"MDtu8_LFbbkCgzCzIoEWng","review_id":"4rgaTVkpjfbYye3brIwtoA","date":"2021-10-03T03:17:22","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9327574968338013,"text_excerpt":"In town for my daughters 18th birthday and this place caught her eye. Service was great and the Dracula burger was amazing! Seriously the best burger I ever had. We also go a strawberry salad and for dessert we got the creme brûlée. We ordered the A+ Bellini drinks and they are strong! The atmosphere is very relaxed and service was super friendly. We walked next door after and bought some of their vampire masks as souvenirs! I will say dinner menu is pretty pricey . $70 for 2 of us"},{"business_id":"MDtu8_LFbbkCgzCzIoEWng","review_id":"952xUOmkHhYUhc1zTWftLg","date":"2021-01-09T11:28:58","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9307351112365723,"text_excerpt":"Stopped by here yesterday evening after a night tour. The place is SOOOO cool! It has such a great ambiance. The staff is friendly and overall provides a great experience. I thought the menu items were really cool. I never had fried deviled eggs. Let alone w/ caviar ! The alligator bites were really good too! Loved the drinks, food, and ambiance overall ! :)"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"MDtu8_LFbbkCgzCzIoEWng","photo_id":"Q8NFCXRvEdt-dPaRjC6Pxw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Q8NFCXRvEdt-dPaRjC6Pxw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8727936744689941},{"business_id":"MDtu8_LFbbkCgzCzIoEWng","photo_id":"OuHn7Ea-JvzcY4d1bKUUlQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/OuHn7Ea-JvzcY4d1bKUUlQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.851723849773407},{"business_id":"MDtu8_LFbbkCgzCzIoEWng","photo_id":"-ghiCJaBLXFNLdzk8mFGNg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/-ghiCJaBLXFNLdzk8mFGNg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.84975266456604}